{{PageBanner|Slot 13th img01 en.png}}
The '''Wildcat Slots''' is a slot machine that can be played during the game's anniversary in all versions, during the [[wikipedia:Golden Week (Japan)|Golden Week]] in [[Nyanko Daisensou]], and during the [[Lunar New Year]] event. The first time they were available was during the 7th anniversary event.

The Wildcat Slots can be accessed by pressing the "Wildcat Slots" button in the upper-right corner of the [[Cat Base Menu]], above the [[Splash Text]]. Playing the slot machine is completely free, but can only be done twice per appearance.

The first spin is rigged to always give three 7s, resulting in 777 [[Cat Food]]. The second gives two 7s and one random other icon, with a different result for each:
